aracter!\nHer name is AlienMixture and she's an Alien who has come to take over Earth and rule it as Queen. \nHer personality is very chaotic, she can be a bit degenerate and bratty!\n\nPose and face expression are up to you!\n\nI would like the art sent in—PSD if possible! Below is a reference for you! Thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1drO-S_3vbs8AJJDOw-kpNl5YP3EYSUQF?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@harikamonohashi/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/de43535a/uploads/origins/65b40253-6980-46f9-97c2-b45e84ef75f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7afd6bf008656e2d72a098a590a37fe0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de43535a/uploads/origins/65b40253-6980-46f9-97c2-b45e84ef75f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7afd6bf008656e2d72a098a590a37fe0, https://si.imgix.net/de43535a/uploads/origins/65b40253-6980-46f9-97c2-b45e84ef75f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77cc2d0ce70aa338b14887a7cb2ea5d1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/de43535a/uploads/origins/65b40253-6980-46f9-97c2-b45e84ef75f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4e551c0024041863291aa65a4244c55 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello :D\nYour artstyle is gorgeous!\nI would like to request an artwork of my VTuber Technoire.\nShe is a cute & cheeky cyberpunk hacker! She made her glasses, which change expressions according to her mood! For example ^^ is happy!\nCurrently she has a cyber and comfy Outfit, so you can choose whichever Outfit and Hairstyle you like best!\n\nHere are my References:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lg7UHQ74uo0rzvohx7OzJectsnxvJSTm?usp=drive_link\n\nI want to use it for my SNS and as a postcard design!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@harikamonohashi/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5cefed3d/uploads/origi