 to meet you!\nHello! Your drawings are really great! 💜\nPlease draw my vtuber!\n\n[Features]\nDonut Bear from Patisserie Planet\nStar above her head,Candy\nBright and kind girl\nLoves desserts and sunflowers\n\n[Usage]\nPersonal use (PC wallpaper, print and display, etc.)\nSNS\nThumbnail on YouTube\n\n[Character]\nPlease refer to the URL for the appearance.\n\n[Composition/Motif]\nIf possible, please keep the layers of the character and background separate.\nWe will leave everything to you.\n\nThank you very much! <3\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1H3y8g1GVOYA08v-46rCnY05flzAVUwaT", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@harikamonohashi/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/07536b02/uploads/origins/055c094d-991f-4ef5-ba79-783240b0f603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=188b02608046d6c6c3ee0a626986f463", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/07536b02/uploads/origins/055c094d-991f-4ef5-ba79-783240b0f603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=188b02608046d6c6c3ee0a626986f463, https://si.imgix.net/07536b02/uploads/origins/055c094d-991f-4ef5-ba79-783240b0f603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=998c88a94d84a2119e5acc0fbb9fa955 2x, https://si.imgix.net/07536b02/uploads/origins/055c094d-991f-4ef5-ba79-783240b0f603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1fea88ccc6ab08219e4c37b5022e750e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art and wanted you to draw my character, KB who's a blonde raccoon. Please make sure not to forget her nose piercing, her face mask (raccoon) and her arm markings! \n\nShe's bratty, spunky, tomboy, and a tsundere with a heart of gold. The pose is up to you, but I'd like it to be dynamic. \n\nShe loves a gothic or punk aesthetic. Thank you.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1xFL3R6gWc5laJT9vsdR-He0eG3lezpup/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@harikamonohashi/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/302c01be/uploads/origins/382e2079-867e-48cf-ae42-233a862e1c47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fadbd3393f14a1730974ce0bdcddf2b6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/302c01be/uploads/origins/382e2079-867e-48cf-ae42-233a862e1c47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fadbd3393f14a1730974ce0bdcddf2b6, https://si.imgix.net/302c01be/uploads/origins/382e2079-867e-48cf-ae42-233a862e1c47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=779e38e29145a243f2c46f59204192ea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/302c01be/uploads/origins/382e2079-867e-48cf-ae42-233a862e1c47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5374d616fa0842e132c500244a616210 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I love the way you draw characters, and how expressive your work is!\n\nI was wondering if I could request some art of my alpaca VTuber, Pakka. She's bratty and usually very sleepy, and lives in a futuristic cyberpunk-like world. Details are up to you, but I'd love if she could look a bit mischievous!\n\nThis art may be on my twitch and social media accounts with credit to you. Thank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://bsky.app/profile/pakka.gay/post/3ldcwleavvc2x", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@harikamonohashi/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/feb616c0/uploads/origins/848ac7fa-13d6-4e88-88e9-348f5d1fc6f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efaaa77f4c117674c00964f7b425a87e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/feb616c0/uploads/origins/848ac7fa-13d6-4e88-88e9-348f5d1fc6f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efaaa77f4c117674c00964f7b425a87e, https://si.imgix.net/feb616c0/uploads/origins/848ac7fa-13d6-4e88-88e9-348f5d1fc6f7?bg=%23fff&auto=f