"", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@harikamonohashi/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/46aba2d5/uploads/origins/19262485-01be-4e55-aece-7f387ad052dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f295b09d57d1e63a206440e5d15e7ed", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/46aba2d5/uploads/origins/19262485-01be-4e55-aece-7f387ad052dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f295b09d57d1e63a206440e5d15e7ed, https://si.imgix.net/46aba2d5/uploads/origins/19262485-01be-4e55-aece-7f387ad052dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=798e5d7a3840ae6c73c80d5d35295b43 2x, https://si.imgix.net/46aba2d5/uploads/origins/19262485-01be-4e55-aece-7f387ad052dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=372cb78f0061cc7b5a2672d297da6aa4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは!!\n\n私のVtuberのキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？やんちゃでグレムリンな狐の女の子です。\n\nどんなポーズでもいいので、描いてください。お酒を飲むのが好きで、魂を盗むのが好きです。\n\n注意点としては、顔の両頬に赤い狐のマークが3つずつあります。顔と肩にソバカスがあります。胸は小さめです。彼女は体が小さい。おてんば娘なんです。長い髪も短い髪もお好みで描いてください。お好みで帽子も入れてください。\n\nSNSに投稿したいです。ありがとうございました。また、私のTwitchでも紹介するかもしれません。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/gingerkitsu-ginger-kitsu-references-all-Vz6KYa0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@harikamonohashi/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/45ff70d7/uploads/origins/fecd895e-16dd-439f-8301-2d5fc57740d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b710f79c9b3e818b11f9d3dc529d944b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/45ff70d7/uploads/origins/fecd895e-16dd-439f-8301-2d5fc57740d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b710f79c9b3e818b11f9d3dc529d944b, https://si.imgix.net/45ff70d7/uploads/origins/fecd895e-16dd-439f-8301-2d5fc57740d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=744941b3ae20d7e76291d446343623d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/45ff70d7/uploads/origins/fecd895e-16dd-439f-8301-2d5fc57740d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d7afdfc85281a3fe3a9d145311f63ea 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I'd like to request you to draw my OC! She is a kitsune who is sultry, and casts charms on people. She looks sweet but has a scary side to her!\nHere are her references: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GLiJ-GhZUsf6LpefyCC3ySH2BUD1pF6o?usp=sharing\nI also have a website with additional information. It is machine translated, I apologize for any errors. https://meikajpn.linryn.art/\n\nPlease draw her however you'd like!\n\nThank you for your consideration! I'm looking forward to it!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@harikamonohashi/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d865043/uploads/origins/29d13016-5582-4486-a4c5-e1cd514b6403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89579ce24239d56154a80d9c48911c33", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d865043/uploads/origins/29d13016-5582-4486-a4c5-e1cd514b6403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89579ce24239d56154a80d9c48911c33, https://si.imgix.net/6d865043/uploads/origins/29d13016-5582-4486-a4c5-e1cd514b6403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f83d43fd6a5d386f6428cbdd475dbbb3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6d865043/uploads/origins/29d13016-5582-4486-a4c5-e1cd514b6403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cad47b06f122788836feb9a5e4e25b08 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I came here because I liked the picture of Veigar that I saw on your subaccount! I would like you to draw my character! : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15_qkp6HIBCp2wUCuzJyW8csFH5yy9DrG I would be happy if you could make the overall atmosphere of the picture as cute and lovely as Veigar. I would like the background to be the purple color that i